function fitMobileCanvas(){if(!window.matchMedia('(max-width: 720px)').matches)return;let canvas=$('#canvas'),wrap=$('.canvas-wrap');if(!canvas||!wrap||!canvas.width||!canvas.height||!wrap.clientWidth||!wrap.clientHeight)return;let ratio=Math.min(wrap.clientWidth/canvas.width,wrap.clientHeight/canvas.height,1);canvas.style.width=`${Math.floor(canvas.width*ratio)}px`;canvas.style.height=`${Math.floor(canvas.height*ratio)}px`}
const __baseDraw=draw;draw=function(fullResolution=false){__baseDraw(fullResolution);if(!state.img)return;let canvas=$('#canvas'),filter=state.recipe?.filter;if(['shadow_recovery','night_lift','backlight','highlight_recovery'].includes(filter))applyAdvancedTone(canvas.getContext('2d'),canvas,filter);else if(filter==='local_clahe')applyLocalClahePreview(canvas.getContext('2d'),canvas);else if(filter==='auto_develop')applyAutoDevelopPreview(canvas.getContext('2d'),canvas,state.recipe);requestAnimationFrame(fitMobileCanvas)};
async function applyMobileCardAction(button){let card=button.closest('.card'),assetId=card.dataset.id,assets=state.library?.assets||[],index=assets.findIndex(asset=>asset.id===assetId),anchorTop=card.getBoundingClientRect().top;try{await api('/api/assets/bulk',{method:'POST',headers:{'Content-Type':'application/json'},body:JSON.stringify({asset_ids:[assetId],action:button.dataset.mobileAction})});state.selected.delete(assetId);await load();if(!state.library.assets.length&&state.page>1){state.page--;await load()}let cards=$$('#grid .card'),target=cards[Math.min(index,cards.length-1)];if(target)requestAnimationFrame(()=>requestAnimationFrame(()=>{let scroller=document.scrollingElement||document.documentElement;scroller.scrollTop+=target.getBoundingClientRect().top-anchorTop}))}catch(error){alert(error.message)}}
if(window.ResizeObserver){new ResizeObserver(()=>fitMobileCanvas()).observe($('.canvas-wrap'))}window.addEventListener('resize',fitMobileCanvas);$('#grid').addEventListener('click',e=>{let button=e.target.closest('[data-mobile-action]');if(!button)return;e.preventDefault();e.stopImmediatePropagation();applyMobileCardAction(button)},true);
let mobileSwipeStart=null;$('#editor').addEventListener('touchstart',event=>{if(event.touches.length===1)mobileSwipeStart={x:event.touches[0].clientX,y:event.touches[0].clientY}},{passive:true});$('#editor').addEventListener('touchend',event=>{if(!mobileSwipeStart||!event.changedTouches.length)return;let touch=event.changedTouches[0],dx=touch.clientX-mobileSwipeStart.x,dy=touch.clientY-mobileSwipeStart.y;mobileSwipeStart=null;if(Math.abs(dx)<60||Math.abs(dx)<Math.abs(dy)*1.25)return;event.preventDefault();openAdjacent(dx<0?1:-1)},{passive:false});
if(!$('#qualityJobStatus'))document.body.insertAdjacentHTML('beforeend','<p id="qualityJobStatus" class="hidden"></p>');
if($('#runAutoJob')&&!$('#runThumbnailJob')){$('#runAutoJob').insertAdjacentHTML('afterend','<button id="runThumbnailJob" class="model-type-card" type="button"><strong>生成缩略图</strong><span>生成等比例缩小图并缓存</span></button><button id="runStackJob" class="model-type-card" type="button"><strong>图片找朋友</strong><span>使用缩略图 pHash 对相邻照片分组</span></button>');$('#runThumbnailJob').onclick=()=>routePath('/jobs/thumbnail-generation');$('#runStackJob').onclick=()=>routePath('/jobs/stacking')}
document.addEventListener('click',event=>{if(event.target.id==='backToJobs')document.querySelector('#fullHistoryPage')?.remove()});
document.querySelector('#backToLibrary')?.remove();
window.addEventListener('popstate',()=>{if(window.location.pathname!=='/jobs/history')document.querySelector('#fullHistoryPage')?.remove()});
$('#jobMonitorCards').onclick=e=>{let button=e.target.closest('[data-open-monitor]');if(button)routePath(`/jobs/${encodeURIComponent(button.dataset.openMonitor)}`)};
